{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國《第14屆首爾國際電影節》將於下月17日在首爾舉行，主辦單位昨日公布入圍名單，角逐「男子人氣獎」的包括男星邊佑錫、金宣虎、池昌旭、蘇志燮、玄彬、朴敘俊、宋江、朴志訓、朴正民、具教煥、任時完及劉海鎮等，入圍「女子人氣獎」的女星則包括文佳煐</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:23:56.529445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:05:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.713270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.713270+00:00","content_hash":"32118a7a58cf2e41218229f24a7a62e7900573c3b68cc67504c24d96348cdb14","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}